UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventmerry26brightholidaylightsexperience22605-20251128@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261127T192538Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270104
SUMMARY:Merry & Bright Holiday Lights Experience
DESCRIPTION:Hop aboard our iconic\, vintage London Double Decker bus for a Merry & Bright Holiday Lights Tour in the heart of Downtown Frederick! This enchanting experience invites you to revel in the festive spirit as we meander through twinkling streets adorned with spectacular light displays. Each turn reveals a new scene\, sure to fill you with joy and wonder. After the delightful 45-minute adventure\, you’ll have the chance to snap a free digital photo with Santa himself\, adding a special touch to your holiday memories. His jolly presence is sure to bring smiles to everyone\, making this a truly magical outing for the whole family. In addition\, warm up with a complimentary hot cocoa from Frederick Social\, the perfect treat to enjoy as you relive the sights and sounds of the evening. This is an ideal opportunity to gather your loved ones and create cherished memories together. Whether you’re a local or visiting for the season\, this tour promises a jolly good time for all! So don your finest festive attire\, grab your friends and family\, and let’s spread some holiday cheer on this charming adventure with Maryland Double Deckers! There are limited tickets available for this signature event\, so be sure to purchase your ticket(s) before they sell out! Go to Maryland Double Deckers and click on the ONLINE BOOKING button at the top of the page! Ticket Includes: 45-minute tour throughout Downtown Frederick\, a digital photo at our “Selfie Station\,” and a complimentary hot cocoa from Frederick Social. Start/End Location: Frederick Social\, 50 Citizen’s Way\, Frederick\, MD 21701
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/merry-%26-bright-holiday-lights-experience/22605/
END:VEVENT
