BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrostyfriday17366-20261127@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261127T192538Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261128
SUMMARY:Frosty Friday
DESCRIPTION:Kick off your holiday season with all day shopping in Downtown Frederick! Parking is FREE\, shops open early and stay open late\, and Downtown Frederick is filled with holiday cheer and decoration. Schedule of Events: Early Bird Bag Giveaway 9AM | 30 N Market St Be one of the first 100 shoppers to score a free holiday goodie bag packed with deals and gifts from local businesses. Available while supplies last\, so come early! Live Holiday Music 9AM – 9PM | Various Locations Enjoy festive live music and carolers all day long as local musicians perform throughout Downtown Frederick. Stroll the streets and let the sounds of the season set the mood. Snowflake Tree: Shop Local 11AM – 5PM | 30 N Market St Shop small and get rewarded! Make two purchases from local businesses totaling $100 or more\, then pick a free present from the Snowflake Tree. Available while supplies last. Photos with Santa 12PM – 3PM | Shab Row Bring the family for a free holiday photo with Santa and share your wish list with the big guy himself. Capture a festive memory you’ll treasure for years to come. Marshmallow Roasting Stations 4PM – 9PM Between shops\, warm up at one of the marshmallow roasting stations in Downtown Frederick. Toast a marshmallow over the open fire\, enjoy a quick winter treat\, and head back out ready to finish your shopping list. Trellis – Boy Scouts | Carroll Creek Park | 4PM – 9PM County Permit Bldg | 30 N Market St | 4PM – 8PM Velvet Lounge | 203 N Market | 4PM – 8PM The Banyan | 216 E Patrick St | 4PM – 8PM Fire Station | 79 S Market St | TBD Holiday Cocktail Kickoff 7PM – 9PM | Participating Locations Sip your way through downtown with $5 festive holiday cocktails at participating bars and restaurants. The full list of locations will be announced soon\, so be sure to check back.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frosty-friday/17366/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
