BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventartiststalk3alegendmythlore26438-20261128@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261127T192538Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
SUMMARY:Artists' Talk: Legend! Myth! Lore!
DESCRIPTION:Join artists Elisabeth Arzt and Kevin Thompson for an artist talk about their collaborative exhibition\, Legend! Myth! Lore! How do we shape our identities\, and what stories do we tell ourselves about who we are and who we might become? In this interactive workshop\, participants will explore these questions through a playful\, Mad Libs-style myth-making game. Each participant will receive a take-home workbook filled with creative prompts to help invent an original character\, creature\, or personal guide. Your avatar might represent a part of yourself\, the person you hope to become\, a protective companion\, a source of humor\, or something entirely imagined. Through storytelling and creative play\, participants will build their own mythology and discover new ways to explore identity\, imagination\, and possibility.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/artists-talk%3a-legend!-myth!-lore!/26438/
END:VEVENT
