BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventpilates26pintsatsmoketownbrewingwithleighgeorge26315-20261128@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261127T192538Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
SUMMARY:Pilates & Pints at Smoketown Brewing with Leigh George
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a unique morning of movement\, community\, and local flavor at Pilates & Pints! We're partnering with Smoketown Brewing in Brunswick to bring our signature Mat Pilates practice to the beautiful Upstairs at Smoketown event space. This all-levels Mat Pilates class combines mindful movement\, breath awareness\, and focused core engagement to build strength\, improve posture\, and enhance flexibility and balance. Through simple yet effective floor-based exercises\, you'll develop stability\, body awareness\, and a sense of ease that supports everyday well-being. After class\, the experience continues downstairs in Smoketown Brewing's welcoming taproom.Your registration includes one drink voucher to enjoy the beverage of your choice\, including Smoketown's craft beers\, handcrafted mocktails\, or other non-alcoholic options. If you prefer wine\, liquor\, or a cocktail\, your voucher provides a $7 discount toward your purchase. Stretch\, strengthen\, and sip local in Brunswick's charming and historic hometown brewery. What to Prepare and Expect: Bring your own mat. Mats will not be available to borrow Dress in comfortable layers After class\, enjoy a free drink voucher redeemable at Smoketown Brewing\, where you can choose from craft beers\, mocktails\, or other non-alcoholic options
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/pilates-%26-pints-at-smoketown-brewing-with-leigh-george/26315/
END:VEVENT
