SUMMARY:Plushies\, Pistons\, and Holiday Traditions
DESCRIPTION:Stuff Rod™ Car Show Load up your ride with your favorite plush passengers and cruise into our one-of-a-kind Stuff Rod™ Car Show! Free admission for spectators $25 to register a Stuff Rod™ 50% of all Stuff Rod™ registration fees benefit Little Wishes\, an organization that grants immediate and ongoing wishes to seriously ill\, hospitalized children. Merry Market & Holiday Bazaar Shop local this Shop Local Saturday! Browse unique gifts\, discover festive finds\, and support our amazing local small businesses. Holiday Drive-In Movie featuring Polar Express Pile into your car or find a seat\, bring your blankets\, pillows\, and PJs\, and enjoy a festive holiday movie experience with family and friends. Drive-In Movie Admission: Just $10 per car advanced online and $15 day of the event. Advance ticket purchase is encouraged. Spots are limited. Ticket Link Coming Soon
