SUMMARY:Small Business Saturday Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:Make this holiday season extra special by supporting local makers on Small Business Saturday! Browse our indoor and outdoor Holiday Market for thoughtful\, handcrafted\, and small-batch gifts for everyone on your list. Vendors: Pots 4 Paws - Handmade functional ceramics Raw Blossom - Candles and self care products Standard Issue Cat Supply - Catnip treats\, toys and cat accessories Prim Pinups - Tiered serving trays and home goods DFF Jewelry - Handstamped metal jewelry Second Helping Books - Used books and bookish goods Kay’s Cosmic Corner - Suncatchers KM Originals - Fine beaded jewelry Resilience - Fine gold jewelry ALSO! We will be operating our fire pit and providing free s’mores kits for guests who make a bar purchase during this event (while supplies last).
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/small-business-saturday-holiday-market/26352/
END:VEVENT
