DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Salsa Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:YOU’RE INVITED to the hottest Dance Party in Town! It’s Frederick Salsa’s THANKSGIVING DANCE PARTY Night!! Grab all of your favorite family\, put on that cute festive outfit and get ready to dance! This is definitely the absolute Dance Party in town and you don't want to miss out on the fun! Saturday 11/28/26 - 8:30PM! Awesome music by DJ-Cesar. If you've never attended a Salsa Night at Rockwell Brewery\, you are missing out on the fun!! ALL ARE WELCOME! Open to Everyone (21+)! Start out the night with a quick salsa dance lesson\, then it's time to hit the dance floor. No experience necessary\, all are welcome! Let the rhythm hit you! Cash Cover at the door.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/thanksgiving-salsa-dance-party/26378/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
