SUMMARY:The Crater Sisters' Christmas Special
DESCRIPTION:When the entire cast and crew quit thirty minutes before her comeback special\, a diva is forced to reunite with the sister she’s not spoken to in three decades. A zany\, musical romp filled with ghosts\, wonder\, delusion\, and the magic of the holidays! Created in part by MET Ensemble Member\, Lori Boyd. THE CRATER SISTERS’ CHRISTMAS SPECIAL BY JOHN MOROGIELLO AND LORI BOYD DIRECTED BY LYNN SHAPR SPEARS MUSIC DIRECTED BY MELYNDA BURDETTE WINTROL CHOREOGRAPHED BY JULIE HERBER NOVEMBER 20 – DECEMBER 20
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-crater-sisters-christmas-special/25835/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventthepigeongetsabigtimeholidayextravaganza25876-20261212@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261127T192538Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
SUMMARY:The Pigeon Gets a Big Time Holiday Extravaganza!
DESCRIPTION:When Mo Willems' characters get together for the holidays\, it's bound to be the biggest extravaganza ever! The Unlimited Squirrels deck the halls and Elephant and Piggie come ready to celebrate! But will The Pigeon join in the festivities\, or will he run all the way to the North Pole in search of the greatest gift ever? Terrific tunes\, silly stories\, goofy gifts\, audience antics: it's all in this brand-new musical party that sleighs!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-pigeon-gets-a-big-time-holiday-extravaganza!/25876/
END:VEVENT
